sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  actor T as Technician
  participant A as Spring Boot API
  participant M as MySQL
  C->>A: Reports an incident (impact, urgency)
  Note over A: priority = impact × urgency<br/>deadline: 2 h, 8 h, 24 h or 48 h
  A->>M: ticket OUVERT, SLA EN_COURS
  T->>A: PUT /my-tickets/{id}
  Note over A: same team, not assigned yet
  A->>M: ticket EN_COURS, history, alert to admin
  alt resolved
    T->>A: POST /my-tickets/{id}/comment
    A->>M: ticket RESOLU, resolution date, history
  else too complex
    T->>A: POST /my-tickets/{id}/escalate
    A->>M: ticket ESCALADE, history, alert to admin
  end
